id: pm-rl-rsipower
title: Evaluate proposer transfer on a statistically powered tracker corpus
description: "The bounded recursive-improver acceptance uses two distinct meta trackers, below the unchanged ten-sample outer gate minimum; item-level inner bounds are also underpowered on the small chronological cohorts. Plan a larger public tracker/task benchmark with an explicit power analysis, account for correlated fleet work, preserve chronological and meta/audit separation, and repeat equal-budget proposer comparisons without relaxing the promotion gate."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: "gh:unbraind/pm-rl#148","gh:unbraind/pm-rl#149"
created_at: "2026-10-19T12:52:29.061Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-12T03:38:34.203Z"
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-rl-apvf
